00:57:29.031 --> 00:57:32.103
I remember he had
all these books in his room.

00:57:33.277 --> 00:57:37.108
And they were all so worn
and scribbled in.

00:57:37.695 --> 00:57:39.317
Like, he didn't just
have them--

00:57:39.421 --> 00:57:42.182
He loved them.
He devoured them.

00:57:44.012 --> 00:57:47.636
I wanted so bad to be his,
the way those books were his.

00:57:49.017 --> 00:57:52.227
But now I wonder
if that was possible.

00:57:52.330 --> 00:57:55.057
If those books were like that
because he loved them...

00:57:56.300 --> 00:57:59.061
...or if they were ripped
and worn and stained

00:57:59.165 --> 00:58:02.996
because that's who he is
and who he wants to be.

00:58:17.804 --> 00:58:19.703
So, this is it, huh?

00:58:21.394 --> 00:58:22.429
This is it.

00:58:31.853 --> 00:58:33.475
