01:15:51.512 --> 01:15:53.341
Aku rasa aku hanya emosional.

01:15:56.275 --> 01:15:58.036
Bisakah kamu memelukku?

01:15:59.382 --> 01:16:00.659
Ya.

01:16:22.681 --> 01:16:24.234
Charlie...

01:16:27.203 --> 01:16:29.101
Aku rasa aku tidak bahagia.

01:16:44.461 --> 01:16:46.118
Dan aku pikir bahwa...

01:16:49.812 --> 01:16:52.090
